        +ROT      A      B      Upward circular rotation of top 3

                  B      C      stack elements

                  C      A



        -ROT      A      C      Downward circular rotation of top 3

                  B      A      stack elements

                  C      B



        DDUP      A      A      Duplicate TOP and TOP-1

                  B      B

